        "startTime": 55.358,
        "endTime": 57.991
      },
      {
        "text": "Grandpa smiles.",
        "startTime": 58.441,
        "endTime": 60.173
      },
      {
        "text": "\"And I don't like salad,\" he says.",
        "startTime": 60.623,
        "endTime": 63.55
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Then what can we eat?\" asks Grandpa.",
        "startTime": 64.45,
        "endTime": 67.026
      },
      {
        "text": "Tom looks at the menu again.",
        "startTime": 67.476,
        "endTime": 69.646
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Pasta!\" he says.",
        "startTime": 70.096,
        "endTime": 72.166
      },
      {
        "text": "They share a big plate of pasta with a red sauce.",
        "startTime": 72.616,
        "endTime": 76.197
      },
      {
        "text": "Tom eats a lot of pasta, and he smiles.",
        "startTime": 76.647,
        "endTime": 80.24
      },
      {
        "text": "The pasta is hot and soft, and the sauce is sweet.",
        "startTime": 80.69,
        "endTime": 84.821
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Do you like it?\" asks Grandpa.",
        "startTime": 85.271,
        "endTime": 87.603
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Yes, I do!\" says Tom.",
        "startTime": 88.053,
        "endTime": 90.078
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Me too!\" says Lily.",
        "startTime": 90.528,
        "endTime": 92.897
      },
      {
        "text": "Lily takes some pasta on her fork.",
        "startTime": 93.347,
        "endTime": 95.931
      },
      {
        "text": "Pip puts his nose up, and Lily gives him a bit of pasta.",
        "startTime": 96.381,
        "endTime": 101.012
      },
      {
        "text": "At the end, Grandpa pays.",
        "startTime": 101.462,
        "endTime": 104.163
      },
      {
        "text": "Grandpa takes a photo of the happy table.",
        "startTime": 104.613,
        "endTime": 107.484
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Thank you, Grandpa,\" says Tom.",
        "startTime": 107.934,
        "endTime": 110.259
      },
      {
        "text": "Grandpa looks at the children and laughs.",
        "startTime": 110.709,
        "endTime": 114.091
      },
      {
        "text": "Everybody is happy.",
        "startTime": 114.541,
        "endTime": 116.546
      }
